Package: CytoCrunch
Type: Package
Title: Flow Cytometry Analysis of 'FlowJo' Plugin Exports
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Joshua", "Luthy", email = "jluthy123@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Loads expression data exported by 'FlowJo' v10 and 'SeqGeq'
    plugin processes into S4 objects. Provides clustering with self-organising
    maps ('EmbedSOM', or optionally 'FlowSOM'), dimensionality reduction with
    'uwot' that keeps the fitted model so new data can be placed into an
    existing map, and plots of embeddings, cluster heatmaps and marker
    comparisons.
